    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e64d332e50f416f36e0e5a1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的神鹰是钻鹰！\n我要像铃鹿前辈那样，\n不断地往前冲刺突破。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c89d705c94f9d578fc34f7f07c2cd60d1f7e78b0d04ceaab04e7f01cd9387a2",
